## 7. v1 Configuration File (Final)

The final `librechat.yaml` for v1 deployment, incorporating all Phase 0 findings:

```yaml
# Target path: /app/api/data/librechat.yaml
# Final v1 feature configuration — update after PBI 9130 sign-off

version: "1.1.0"
cache: true

endpoints:
  custom:
    - name: "LiteLLM Gateway"
      apiKey: "${LITELLM_VIRTUAL_KEY}"
      baseURL: "https://<LITELLM_URL>/v1"
      models:
        default: ["ROMTech AI Standard"]
        fetch: true
      titleConvo: true
      titleModel: "ROMTech AI Fast"
      summarize: true
      streamRate: 15

interface:
  modelSelect: true
  parameters: true
  presets: true
  sidePanel: true
  prompts:
    use: true
    create: true
    share: false
    public: false
  endpointsMenu: false

capabilities: []
```

